+/-- Section 7.1: ONE positive floor/radius is selected before EVERY allowed
+singleton vector and EVERY actual near-minimum full behavioral profile.
+The positive threshold is retained; there is no claim as eta tends to zero. -/
+theorem exists_screenedSingletonFiberUniformCollar
+    (coordinates : QuittingFreeRewardCoordinate (Fin 4) → ℝ)
+    (hcoordinates : ∀ coordinate, |coordinates coordinate| ≤ 1)
+    (hpolynomial : screenedRootPolynomialEval coordinates screenedRootExclusionPolynomial ≠ 0)
